  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit poultry from Democratic Republic Congo to the Netherlands 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of this study visit to the Netherlands is to inspire key stakeholders in the Congolese poultry sector and to raise awareness of relevant Dutch services and solutions. This aims to strengthen the relationship between Democratic Republic Congo (DRC) and The Netherlands. The long-term goal is to contribute to the development of the Congolese poultry sector, enhancing self-sufficiency in poultry, meat, and egg production in the DRC by leveraging Dutch expertise and skills, which will potentially create trade opportunities for the Dutch private sector. By strengthening the relationship between Congolese poultry sector stakeholders and the Dutch poultry sector many opportunities can be created. The expected outcome of this project is the successful participation of key stakeholders in the Congolese poultry sector in a study visit to the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
